    /// <summary>ESC：优先关密码/创建窗，其次私聊窗，再关房间详情，最后右键菜单（不导航）。由 JS keydown 触发。</summary>
    [JSInvokable]
    public Task OnLobbyEsc()
    {
        if (_joinPwOpen)
            CloseJoinPw();
        else if (_createOpen)
            CloseCreateDialog();
        else if (_pmOpen)
            ClosePm();
        else if (_rpMenuOpen)
            CloseRpmMenu();
        else if (_selectedGame is not null)
            CloseGameDetail();
        else if (_menuOpen)
            CloseContextMenu();
        return Task.CompletedTask;
    }

